/* Compared with supplied internet_customers.sql export (23 Oct 2026).
   Direct UPDATE only: confirmed whole Net ID matches, ignoring case and outer spaces.
   Each update also checks the exported customer ID. Missing IDs are ignored.
   Assigns the supplied email directly, including when the same email is already stored.
   Existing primary emails are replaced; additional_emails are unchanged.
   Invalid email entry tcv_demo2 -> . is skipped. Other spellings preserved.
   Do not run mysql with --force. Comparison details are in the companion CSV.
*/
